# Deployment artifacts.
#
# The zips are regenerable build output (~49 MB). The SQL dumps carry the
# admin password hash and the API-token hashes along with the content, so they
# are credential material as much as data — they belong in a backup location,
# not in a shared repository. See DEPLOYMENT.md for how to regenerate both.
deploy/*.zip
deploy/*.tar.gz
deploy/*.sql
deploy/db-parts/
